  Support reaches the patch boundary, so the gradient reaches
  the whole input and that measure saturates and cannot rank
  placements. The theoretical field exceeds this patch, which
  makes it an unreachable bound here rather than merely a
  loose one. Compare the mass columns.

  Dominance requires more reach at lower cost. Cost is measured
  by bench_receptive_field.py; if a reach column above does not
  hold, the claim must be narrowed to the columns that do.
